{"id": "60937", "title": "情倾宫闱／渡红尘", "author": "admin", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 47, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/60/60937.htm", "intro": "属性分类：古代/宫廷江湖/生子/正剧/美攻 \r\n\r\n文案： \r\n\r\n\r\n原名《渡红尘》\r\n一缕青丝，一生惆怅……阡陌红尘如何渡？风情月债，只叫人生死难离，无尽痛…… \r\n皇帝攻x将军受\r\n\r\n帝位与爱情，江山与美人，就真的不能共存吗？\r\n而将万千宠爱集於一个男性，又会遭到怎样的世俗非议？\r\n\r\n大燕史上第一位手握重兵权，一人之下万人之上，叱吒风云的将军；\r\n第一位揭竿叛乱，打下大燕半边江山，却被免於死刑的将军；\r\n儿时的情谊烟消云散，繾綣深情只换来血淋淋的伤害。\r\n一再被宣侍寝，重复著令人羞耻的行為，被迫诞下皇子……\r\n柯卫卿的心越来越榜徨，生怕自己会就此堕落下去，迷失在煌夜的怀抱裡。\r\n\r\n——但是，他逃得掉吗？", "base": "files/article/html/60/60937", "chapters": [{"title": "1-8", "file": "8958691.html", "available": false}, {"title": "9-16", "file": "8958693.html", "available": false}, {"title": "17-23", "file": "8958695.html", "available": false}, {"title": "24-29", "file": "8958696.html", "available": false}, {"title": "30-35", "file": "8958697.html", "available": false}, {"title": "36-40", "file": "8958699.html", "available": false}, {"title": "41-46", "file": "8958701.html", "available": false}, {"title": "47-51", "file": "8958702.html", "available": false}, {"title": "52-59", "file": "8958703.html", "available": false}, {"title": "60-65", "file": "8958706.html", "available": false}, {"title": "66-70", "file": "8958707.html", "available": false}, {"title": "71-76", "file": "8958709.html", "available": false}, {"title": "77-81", "file": "8958711.html", "available": false}, {"title": "82-85", "file": "8958713.html", "available": false}, {"title": "86-90", "file": "8958714.html", "available": false}, {"title": "91-95", "file": "8958715.html", "available": false}, {"title": "96-102", "file": "8958717.html", "available": false}, {"title": "103-108", "file": "8958719.html", "available": false}, {"title": "109-114", "file": "8958721.html", "available": false}, {"title": "115-120", "file": "8958723.html", "available": false}, {"title": "121-126", "file": "8958725.html", "available": false}, {"title": "127-131", "file": "8958726.html", "available": 